{"title":"Career Roadmap · Exhibition Coordinator","role":"Exhibition Coordinator","summary":"An Exhibition Coordinator plans and coordinates the development, installation, operation and public delivery of museum, gallery, heritage and cultural exhibitions.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Exhibition Coordinator plans and coordinates the development, installation, operation and public delivery of museum, gallery, heritage and cultural exhibitions."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Museology"},{"text":"Heritage management"},{"text":"Curatorial practice"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Collections"},{"text":"Visitor experience"},{"text":"Interpretation"},{"text":"Exhibition design"},{"text":"Education and outreach"},{"text":"Digital technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Museology / Heritage Management is a relevant foundation. However, an Exhibition Coordinator is usually a project and operations-oriented museum professional, so the student should supplement academic knowledge with exhibition planning, collections documentation, budgeting, vendor coordination, digital tools, interpretation and practical museum experience."},{"type":"p","text":"For senior curatorial, collections or museum-management positions, a relevant master's degree and substantial practical experience are often advantageous or required depending on the institution."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Expected Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Foundation & Practical Experience"},{"text":"Museum studies + heritage + exhibition projects + internships"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Exhibition Operations"},{"text":"Exhibition Assistant, Programme Coordinator, Exhibition Coordinator"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Coordination"},{"text":"Senior Exhibition Coordinator, Exhibition Manager, Project Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Exhibition Head, Museum Programme Manager, Cultural Project Director, Exhibition Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should develop seven core capabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Museology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Museum history"},{"text":"Museum theory"},{"text":"Collection management"},{"text":"Museum ethics"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Conservation basics"},{"text":"Museum education"},{"text":"Visitor studies"},{"text":"Museum administration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Heritage Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tangible heritage"},{"text":"Intangible heritage"},{"text":"Archaeological heritage"},{"text":"Built heritage"},{"text":"Cultural landscapes"},{"text":"Heritage interpretation"},{"text":"Heritage conservation"},{"text":"Community participation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Exhibition Development"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the complete lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Concept","Research","Storyline","Objects","Interpretation","Design","Production","Installation","Opening","Visitor Engagement","Evaluation"]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Project Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Budgeting"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Vendor management"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Team coordination"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Timeline management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Interpretation & Storytelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to convert research into:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exhibition narratives"},{"text":"Object labels"},{"text":"Wall texts"},{"text":"Timelines"},{"text":"Interactive displays"},{"text":"Audio guides"},{"text":"Educational materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Digital Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Adobe Creative Cloud"},{"text":"Basic Photoshop"},{"text":"Basic Illustrator"},{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Digital asset management systems"},{"text":"Museum collection databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"Public speaking"},{"text":"Stakeholder communication"},{"text":"Vendor negotiation"},{"text":"Team coordination"},{"text":"Visitor engagement"}]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Museum & Heritage Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic focus"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to Museology"},{"text":"Museum history"},{"text":"Heritage studies"},{"text":"Art and cultural history"},{"text":"Archaeology basics"},{"text":"Anthropology"},{"text":"Indian cultural heritage"},{"text":"Museum ethics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Object identification"},{"text":"Basic documentation"},{"text":"Cataloguing"},{"text":"Photography"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Archival research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mini-project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a hypothetical exhibition concept:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"Traditional Crafts of South India\""},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Theme"},{"text":"Target audience"},{"text":"Object list"},{"text":"Exhibition storyline"},{"text":"Basic gallery layout"},{"text":"Visitor journey"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Exhibition Planning & Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Curatorial practice"},{"text":"Exhibition design"},{"text":"Collection management"},{"text":"Interpretation"},{"text":"Museum education"},{"text"